    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>This area has a real advantage: the two closest dog-friendly beaches (l'Hippodrome in Cagnes-sur-Mer and Vaugrenier in Villeneuve-Loubet) each have a dog shower, a real plus for an extended stay.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you book</h2>
      <p>Several campsites in the area, notably around Cagnes-sur-Mer, accept animals — conditions still need to be checked case by case, as is often the case.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: this area is ideal for easily switching between two different beaches depending on how busy the day is.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Marina Baie des Anges, with its unmistakable architecture, is worth a look at the end of a walk on Vaugrenier beach.</p>
